Package: aveecare-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), ${misc:Depends}
Description: command line tool for the AveeCare home care API
 The official command line tool for the AveeCare API. List, create and update
 a home care agency's patients, visits, caregivers, invoices and more from the
 terminal, cron jobs and shell scripts. Output is JSON, so it pipes straight
 into jq.
 .
 This package installs the aveecare command.
